# Hits: while loops whose condition reads only locals/params the body never changes.
# FP shapes (non-hits): field changed by a callee (TBox.Run), variable modified in
# the body (Inc / assignment), variable passed to a call (possible var parameter),
# loop left through Break / Exit, and a condition containing a call.
loop-condition-invariant 31
loop-condition-invariant 42
!loop-condition-invariant 22
!loop-condition-invariant 51
!loop-condition-invariant 62
!loop-condition-invariant 72
!loop-condition-invariant 82
!loop-condition-invariant 93
!loop-condition-invariant 99
